{"t":"Imprisoned Cyclops (Book)","s":"imprisoned-cyclops-book-02dd5","k":"item","i":"assets/wiki/Book_Brown_c51021.gif","q":1,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><div class=\"twbox\">\n<aside class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-twbox pi-layout-default\" role=\"region\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"title\">Untitled</h2>\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\">\n<img alt=\"Book (Brown)\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Book_Brown_c51021.gif\" width=\"32\"/>\n</figure>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">General Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"location\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Location</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><p><a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"32226,32277,7\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">Thais Lighthouse (32226, 32277, 7)</a></p></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"blurb\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Short Description</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">A man has imprisoned two cyclops.</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"author\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Author</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Unknown</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"relatedpages\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Related Articles</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Cyclops\">Cyclops</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Thais%20Lighthouse\">Thais Lighthouse</a></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"returnpage\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Return to</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><p>Thais Libraries.</p></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"implementation-date\">Pre-6.0<br/>November 2, 2000</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><p>\t    See also: Libraries <span class=\"explained\">Help</span></p></nav>\n</aside>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-book-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<p class=\"no-results\">This book has no notes.</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-book-text\">\n<blockquote class=\"book\"><p><br/>I've managed to imprison two cyclops in my secret dungeon under the lighthouse. I forced them to create some magic equipment. Soon I will be the mightiest warrior \nin Tibia.</p></blockquote>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>","quests":["thais-lighthouse-quest"],"howto":{"quests":[{"slug":"thais-lighthouse-quest","quest":"Thais Lighthouse Quest","step":"0-1","n":2,"title":"Ler o livro (opcional)","kind":"mention","coords":[]}],"spots":[{"x":32226,"y":32277,"z":7,"text":"Thais Lighthouse"}]}}